{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55653","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十一 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名利梯媒事已忘，唯凭拙直定行藏。\n探玄休炼长生药，助道时抄歇食方。\n溪汲古痕山雨涨，树摧残枿野风狂。\n一言欲寄休回首。\n尘路如今事正忙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}